WEBVTT

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.240
Are you watching, Mitsuki?

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.740
The device you created
 is connecting two worlds.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.250
Your hopes and mine will finally become one.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.360
How could they do this?

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.130
At this rate, Tokyo will be...

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.470
Yeah. We have to stop them.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:36.540
Kark!

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.480
The gates have finally opened.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.580
Though I am eager to 
reach the land I long for,

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:17.490
if I leave with regrets, it will
 put a damper on my departure.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.950
This guy!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.080
Wait, Kotetsu.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.590
It's me that Kark wants.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:25.450
You guys head to the Foundation's HQ.

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.250
But...

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.930
We can't leave you!

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:29.870
Just go!

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.420
Chihiro's right.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.670
If we delay here, Tokyo will be consumed.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.660
I'm going.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.590
I won't be able to face Inuki otherwise.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.160
Kotecchan.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.600
Chihiro-san, be careful.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.850
I will. You, too.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.340
Later, Chihhi.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.060
We've got this.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.710
Thanks for waiting, Kark.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.220
Don't worry about it.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:04.830
The god of death is not so boorish
 that he rushes final farewells.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.860
I don't plan to die.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.080
There's someone I want to see.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.580
Regrets cloud the soul.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.590
The least I can do is beautifully
 embellish it with my requiem.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.590
The serpent god of death that
 swallows the world, Jörmungandr.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:24.100
You... Again?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.720
The Lord of Vermilion demands
 thousands of offerings.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:34.310
You are to blame for everything,
 Kamina Chihiro.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.380
Listen to the grievances of the people.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.820
This is your redemption.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.340
I already told you.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.910
I won't ask for forgiveness.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.580
I will shoulder all the blame.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:05.500
The soul of the one closest
 to the Lord of Vermilion...

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.540
shall be mine.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:12.690
What is that?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.190
That's the Foundation HQ?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:18.460
Looks like an ordinary mansion to me.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:23.000
Grumman and Professor Mitsuki
 once conducted their research there.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:27.350
Everything is in motion. They are
 trying to bring about the end.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.010
You're sure this is it?

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:30.150
Kotecchan!

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.710
If you want answers, ask difficult questions.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.120
How truly scholarly.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.010
She acts like this doesn't affect her.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.320
Densuke, go!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.900
Second summer president, Tsubaki the Red,
 also known as Manazuru Tsubaki,

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.150
is on the way!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.120
Nice!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.660
What a waste.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.150
No blade can pierce Jormungandr's scales.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.150
Revel and exalt.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:53.740
Death is kind and precious. 
 Its beauty is arresting.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.680
Did I lose consciousness?

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:04.300
It's me?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.470
Yes, you.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.550
Could it be?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.920
It's all right. Not yet.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:16.550
I see. I wouldn't want to die
 without accomplishing my goal.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.230
But it's finally my turn, huh?

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.980
How would you like to die?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.650
You're the one responsible
 for my prophetic dreams.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:32.640
You've been taunting me with illusions.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.410
They were not illusions. 
They're your memories.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.900
Everything is like a play.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:43.210
It is performed countless
 times over and over again,

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.840
though each time, the cast
 and ad-libbing changes.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.380
However, the conclusion never changes.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.390
These are my memories?

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.720
In other plays.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.020
The dreams are a warning, to prevent you
 from committing the same mistakes.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.760
Why? Why only me?!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:08.740
When one curtain fell, you raised another.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:13.550
I don't know why, but that's the reason.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.140
I know why.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.340
In other words, I've never
 been forgiven in any play.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.850
I thought I would be in the next one.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.810
It's pathetic.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.550
Even the worst play has its merits.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:35.350
This is the first time so many vessels
 of Heroic Lineage have survived.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.950
Can I change how it ends?

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.770
That's up to you.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.180
Densuke!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:45.400
How dare you!

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.940
No, Tsubaki-chan!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.420
There's no end to them.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.550
Koume-san, go on without us.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.330
What?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.950
You're right.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:56.130
What are you talking about?

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.420
If we delay, Tokyo will be in trouble, right?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.870
We're counting on you, Koume-san!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.070
You guys had better not die!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.330
We've drawn the short straw.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:15.660
Really? I'm pretty happy to be alone with you.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:21.280
Kotecchan? Is this the time 
to say that kind of stuff?

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:22.350
Sorry.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.820
I'm not great at reading the room.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.200
But I don't want to have any regrets.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.110
There's no need to apologize.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.110
I'm all fired up, now!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:35.160
You can tell me all about it later.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.600
I will. I promise I'll protect you!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.870
Coming through!

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.750
Kill them, Chiyu.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.780
If I am not here to manage it, the odds
 it will run out of control increase.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.380
That's fine.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.900
If they close the gate before
 I see Mitsuki, I'll lose everything.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.290
Please, my beloved daughter.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.250
Sophist.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.390
What was that?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:09.500
You attempt to manipulate us
 by pretending to love us.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.370
Me. Yuri. Even Professor Mitsuki.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:18.200
The love you speak of is for yourself only.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.160
Quiet, doll!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.330
Yes.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:28.590
You used your and Professor Mitsuki's
 DNA to create me as a substitute for her.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.700
That's how I know.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:36.340
I am both Professor Mitsuki
 and Shiraki Aldo Grumman.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.800
You can only love yourself.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.420
Y-You're wrong. I loved Mitsuki.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:50.290
One more thing: Professor
 Mitsuki never loved you.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.510
I can tell.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.650
You can open the gate,
 but she won't be waiting for you.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.350
There's no way she would.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:05.480
She simply wishes to return to her family.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.080
Are you Mitsuki?

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:10.880
Bastards!

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.820
I refuse to believe this.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:16.760
Huh?

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.530
I don't believe it.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.030
I refuse to believe it.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.370
I don't believe you!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.020
You're alive, defect.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.220
You haven't changed, Chiyu.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.890
You've been looking down your nose
 at me since our time at the orphanage.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:40.780
Really?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:44.160
Move, Chiyu! Don't blame me if you get hurt!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.910
You bitch!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.900
This is all because of
 a foolish man's obsession.

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.860
There's no reason for me to
 fulfill my duty anymore,

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:58.010
but a foolish woman's curiosity
 wants to see how it ends.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.410
That is the reason I fight.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:10.580
Moment by moment, the wheel of fate turns.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.190
Are you saying we're all going to die?

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.520
It could end like this.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:19.180
I'd simply go watch a new play.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.180
They entrusted me with their dying wishes.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:27.700
Inuki-san, Kakihara-san,
 Kurokami-san, Shoko-san.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.540
Even Aoi Jun fought desperately.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.910
They weren't just following 
the destiny laid out for them,

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.700
they were fighting back.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.720
I'll never give up.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.750
What will you do by changing the script?

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.230
I...

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:46.810
Live.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.490
Live.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:50.560
Live.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.580
Live.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:52.500
Live.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.380
Live.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.190
Live, Chihiro.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.080
I'll live!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.580
The winds are changing.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.080
I'll fight until the very end.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.430
I will change my fate!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:18.640
What?

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:31.850
Impossible.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:35.840
He's incinerating the god that
 brings about the end?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.310
Not bad.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.050
Lord of Vermilion.

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:49.910
You're all that's left, Kark.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.640
Burning gods and destroying demons...

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.570
These are no longer the deeds of humans.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.670
To what end have you 
abandoned your humanity?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.750
You're wrong, Kark.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.100
People's wishes...

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.750
The wishes of the people important
 to me have made me stronger.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.210
Your existence is an affront to the gods of death.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.520
You will never be forgiven.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:18.900
I will not forgive you! Kamina Chihiro!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.650
Amadeus!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.220
My hands! My hands!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.370
My piano! My piano!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.380
This is what you deserve, Kark.

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:42.120
I was so close to his land.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:46.310
Someone play the piano for me.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:50.480
Play for me the ultimate requiem.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.290
This is starting to get tough.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.230
Is this the end?

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.440
Huh?

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.040
You disgrace yourself, Tsubaki.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.280
And you call yourself a member
 of the Guardian State?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.810
Julijuli? Why?

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.290
It goes without saying.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:18.560
The Guardian State exists to
 protect the world from evil spirits.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.450
We're just doing our job.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.700
Thanks for saving us.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.550
Don't thank us.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.450
Destroy all demons!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.070
Exorcise them, Gabriel!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.220
Crush them, Lia Fáil!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.640
Don't underestimate me!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.350
This is pointless.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.980
I've already calculated all your movements.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.270
Is that right?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:42.770
Take this!

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.730
What?

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:50.700
Don't assume everything will
 always go according to plan.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:55.580
There are people in this world
 who challenge the impossible!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.010
How dare you...

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:01.880
You defect.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.560
There's no such thing as a defective life.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:09.100
Life is obligated to struggle
 until the very end.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:12.390
That's why it's worth saving!

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:20.390
That's probably what Inuki would say.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.580
Stop the machine.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.150
I can't.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:28.440
Enough.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:34.160
Now that I can't control 
the machine, it's all over.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.330
It's her punishment for mocking me.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:44.840
No one can deceive me!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:49.850
I'm coming for you, Mitsuki!

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:52.840
Let me give you a hand!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.630
Mitsuki!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.600
Idiot!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.890
Did they succeed?

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.820
No, they failed.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:12.430
Now that it's beyond control,
 the gate will continue to expand.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:14.560
Eventually it will consume the world.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:15.990
No...

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.890
Not yet. I won't give up yet.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.380
There must be a way!

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:24.040
Tell me, Dux! Please!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.040
There is one thing.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.250
The Lord of Vermilion.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:36.730
<i>The Lord of Vermilion has the
 power to create new worlds.</i>

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.550
<i>As the candidate closest to becoming it,</i>

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:41.600
<i>it would be possible
 for you to erase the gate.</i>

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:43.880
<i>However...</i>

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.190
Yuri.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.350
Where are you going, Chihiro-kun?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.280
Step aside, Yuri.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.290
You won't answer me?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.690
Then I'll say it.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.290
You're planning to enter the gate.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.270
The Lord of Vermilion could erase the gate.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:15.490
However, that requires countering
 one power with another...

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.720
in exchange for your life.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.510
How do you know that?

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:24.090
Because someone was kind enough to tell me...

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.100
that you would die.

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:30.610
That's right, Yuri. Save Chihiro.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.570
Kill him!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.100
Why?!

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.870
Why do you have to throw away your life?!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:42.290
I know why I was told to live!

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:45.850
As long as I'm alive, I can keep using my life!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:48.840
That makes no sense! I don't understand!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.280
I don't want to understand!

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:52.300
I'm sorry.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.180
You've changed.

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:58.180
You'd never leave me without saying anything!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.680
Please, Yuri! Let me—

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:01.800
I won't let you go!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.140
I'll never be forgiven anyway.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.850
I killed Cerdid-san with these hands.

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:15.720
You're wrong! You were
 forced to defend yourself.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.860
It doesn't change the fact that I killed her.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:23.080
So I will protect you instead.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.330
I won't let you die!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.250
Stop, Yuri!

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.910
There's no turning back for me now.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:36.130
But I can at least save you.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.510
Why? How did this happen?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.550
I was reunited with you.

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.160
We drank hot cocoa in the sun together.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.850
It made me happy.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:51.590
I just wanted to keep doing that!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:53.980
Chihiro-kun!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.400
Yuri!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.200
Chihiro-kun...

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:24.330
I could never kill the most
 important person in my life.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.140
You haven't changed.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:31.270
Chihiro-kun, you haven't changed.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:35.640
I... What have I been doing?

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.370
I'm sorry, Chihiro-kun.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.200
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.530
It's fine, Yuri.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.270
Chihiro-kun.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.900
I'm sorry, Yuri. I...

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.830
I won't stop you.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.320
Take me with you.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.260
What?

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:03.710
I don't have much strength left, but
 I think I can provide a little assistance.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:07.370
No. I can't do that. You have to stay.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:08.310
Don't leave me!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:10.880
Please.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:15.900
I can't live without you anymore.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.740
Yuri...

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.740
Aren't you scared, Yuri?

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.450
No, I'm with you.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:31.910
Don't let go of my hand.

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:34.970
Stay with me forever.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.280
I will.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:43.770
In a beautiful sky without conflict,
 we'll walk together forever.

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.600
Like Romeo and Juliet?

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.630
Don't you like it?

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:52.600
I don't know what to say. It's a tragedy.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.440
We're different.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.040
You're right.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:03.740
Maybe I'll try saying my own one-liner.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:05.410
What is it?

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:07.670
Yuri.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:10.910
Give me the courage to do this.

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:13.830
Chihiro-kun!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.220
Wait!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.230
No!

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:23.650
I'm sorry, Yuri.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:26.890
I can't take you with me.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.760
Why? Why not?!

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.610
Live, Yuri.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.840
Live for me.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:37.060
You're more important to me
 than anyone or anything.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.460
Chihiro-kun!

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.380
Promise me, Yuri.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.720
Live.

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:47.750
Yes.

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:51.700
Yes. I promise.

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.480
Thank you.

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.960
Now I'll finally be...

00:21:57.940 --> 00:21:59.990
Chihiro-kun!

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:25.820
<b>The World is Vast and Infinite</b>
